cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the RevMeta vocabulary, Codebook or mappings, please cite this resource."
type: dataset
title: "RevMeta — Review Metadata"
authors:
  - family-names: "Mirończuk"
    given-names: "Marcin Michał"
version: "1.0.0"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Controlled SKOS vocabulary for describing methodological features of
  research review publications. The resource comprises 102 concepts in
  14 facets, machine-readable coding guidance, and 141 reviewed SSSOM
  mapping records (107 concrete external links and 34 source-bounded
  NoTermFound decisions).
keywords:
  - "review methodology"
  - "research synthesis"
  - "controlled vocabulary"
  - "SKOS"
  - "SSSOM"
